#!/usr/bin/env bash
#SBATCH --account=chopinsong
#SBATCH --partition=standard
#SBATCH --nodes=1
#SBATCH --ntasks=1
#SBATCH --cpus-per-task=4
#SBATCH --time=01:00:00
#SBATCH --job-name=sfc-i013-aggregate
#SBATCH --output=aggregate_%j.out
#SBATCH --error=aggregate_%j.err
set -euo pipefail
readonly REPO_ROOT=/xdisk/chopinsong/tianyihu/elm-olmt
readonly CANONICAL_SCRIPT="${REPO_ROOT}/development/spinup_forcing_coupling/slurm/iter013/aggregate_iter013.slurm"
test -n "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG:-}"
test -f "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG}"
test -n "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG_SHA256:-}"
test "$(sha256sum "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG}" | awk '{print $1}')" = "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG_SHA256}"
cmp -s "${CANONICAL_SCRIPT}" "$0"
set -a
# shellcheck disable=SC1090
source "${SUBMISSION_CONFIG}"
set +a
test "${ITERATION_ID}" = iter013
test "${STAGE}" = aggregate
test "$(git -C "${REPO_ROOT}" rev-parse HEAD)" = "${REPOSITORY_COMMIT}"
(cd "${REPO_ROOT}" && sha256sum -c "${SOURCE_MANIFEST}")
sha256sum -c "${DEPENDENCY_MANIFEST}"
module load "${MICROMAMBA_MODULE}"
micromamba run -n "${MICROMAMBA_ENV}" python \
  "${REPO_ROOT}/development/spinup_forcing_coupling/slurm/iter013/aggregate_iter013.py" \
  --abby-dir "${ABBY_ANALYSIS_DIR}" \
  --jerc-dir "${JERC_ANALYSIS_DIR}" \
  --accounting "${ACCOUNTING_CSV}" \
  --output-dir "${AGGREGATE_OUTPUT}"
